{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "%@ link" : {
      "comment" : "Payment method editor sheet: title when adding a payment link, with the service's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ link"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ username or link" : {
      "comment" : "Payment method editor: link field header, with the service's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ felhasználónév vagy link"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld/%lld" : {
      "comment" : "Character counter under the handle field: characters used / limit.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$lld/%2$lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "32 characters max. Nobody's typing all that." : {
      "comment" : "HandleError.tooLong",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Legfeljebb 32 karakter. Ezt senki nem fogja begépelni."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "50 characters max. It has to fit on a receipt." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding: display name too long.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Legfeljebb 50 karakter. Rá kell férnie a blokkra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Hungarian account number has 16 or 24 digits." : {
      "comment" : "Bank account validation error.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A magyar számlaszám 16 vagy 24 számjegyből áll."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A little trickles in here and there" : {
      "comment" : "Avatar persona slogan: money keeps dripping in. Hungarian original: 'Egy kicsit csurran-cseppen'.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Egy kicsit csurran-cseppen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A receipt listing what Squabble does — split any bill, scan the receipt, work out who owes what, send petty reminders — every line free, total zero." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver description of the decorative welcome-screen receipt.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Számla arról, mit tud a Squabble: számla elosztása, blokk beolvasása, ki mivel tartozik, kicsinyes emlékeztetők — minden tétel ingyen, a végösszeg nulla."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Account" : {
      "comment" : "Account screen title and toolbar button.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fiók"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Account holder" : {
      "comment" : "Payment editor: field title for the bank account holder's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Számlatulajdonos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Account no." : {
      "comment" : "Payment slip: field label, abbreviated as on a printed form.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Számlasz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Account number or IBAN" : {
      "comment" : "Payment method editor: bank account field.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Számlaszám vagy IBAN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Account number: %@" : {
      "comment" : "Payment method editor: the typed IBAN as a Hungarian account number.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Számlaszám: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Account numbers are digits only — or paste an IBAN instead." : {
      "comment" : "Bank account validation error.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A számlaszám csak számjegyekből áll – vagy illessz be inkább egy IBAN-t."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a bill and we'll find something." : {
      "comment" : "Home empty-state description.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adj hozzá egy számlát, találunk okot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a photo" : {
      "comment" : "Avatar photo source sheet: title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fotó hozzáadása"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a way to pay you" : {
      "comment" : "Button and sheet title for adding a payment method.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fizetési mód hozzáadása"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also accepts" : {
      "comment" : "Payment slip: label for any extra payment methods.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elfogad még"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Amount" : {
      "comment" : "Payment slip: field label.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Összeg"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An IBAN starts with a country code, like HU or DE." : {
      "comment" : "IBANError.invalidFormat",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Az IBAN országkóddal kezdődik, például HU vagy DE."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Annoys the bird." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint for the tappable welcome-screen bird.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Felbosszantja a madarat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple didn't return an authorization code." : {
      "comment" : "AuthError.missingAuthorizationCode",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Az Apple nem küldött engedélyezési kódot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple didn't return an identity token." : {
      "comment" : "AuthError.missingIdentityToken",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Az Apple nem küldött azonosító tokent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arccal és névvel vállalom" : {
      "comment" : "Avatar caption for the user's own photo. A Hungarian pop culture reference, deliberately the same in every language.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Arccal és névvel vállalom"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At least 3 characters. Even birds have longer names." : {
      "comment" : "HandleError.tooShort",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Legalább 3 karakter. Még a madaraknak is hosszabb nevük van."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding: back button accessibility label.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vissza"
          }
        }
