          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ilyen hosszú IBAN nem létezik."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the name on every bill — and on every reminder that you're owed money." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding: name step subtitle.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ez a név áll majd minden számlán — és minden emlékeztetőn, hogy tartoznak neked."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This wipes your account and everything in it. Your friends will still owe you money — that part's between you and them." : {
      "comment" : "Confirmation dialog message before account deletion.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ez törli a fiókod és mindent, ami benne van. A barátaid ettől még tartoznak neked — az már a ti dolgotok."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TOTAL" : {
      "comment" : "Prop receipt total row label.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ÖSSZESEN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try again" : {
      "comment" : "Retry button — profile failed to load, or a handle check failed.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Újrapróbálom"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unique. It's how people find you." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding: handle hint.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Egyedi. Ezzel találnak meg."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "username" : {
      "comment" : "Payment editor: payment link username placeholder.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "felhasználónév"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We can't reach the nest" : {
      "comment" : "Profile failed to load: sheet title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nem érjük el a fészket"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We cannot go into never-ending spirals of debt" : {
      "comment" : "Avatar persona slogan: a European political quote, originally in English.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nem kerülhetünk véget nem érő adósságspirálokba"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "we'll phrase it nicely" : {
      "comment" : "Receipt note under the reminders line.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "szépen fogalmazunk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What do we call you?" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding: name step title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hogy szólíthatunk?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whatever you owe." : {
      "comment" : "Payment slip: the amount field, filled in.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Amennyivel tartozol."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where should the money go?" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding: payment step title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hová menjen a pénz?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who owes what" : {
      "comment" : "Receipt line item — an app feature, priced at zero.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ki mivel tartozik"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whose account is it?" : {
      "comment" : "Payment editor: holder name missing.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kinek a számlája?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You need a handle. It's how people find you." : {
      "comment" : "HandleError.missing",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kell egy felhasználónév. Ezzel találnak meg."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're not signed in." : {
      "comment" : "AuthError.notSignedIn",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nem vagy bejelentkezve."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're offline. Connect to the internet so we can check this handle." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding: handle can't be checked because the device is offline; blocks continuing.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nincs net. Csatlakozz, hogy ellenőrizni tudjuk ezt a felhasználónevet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're offline. This part needs the internet — try again when you're back." : {
      "comment" : "ProfileError.offline",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nincs net. Ehhez a részhez kell — próbáld újra, ha visszajött."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your face, your rules. Mostly your face." : {
      "comment" : "Avatar photo source sheet: subtitle.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A te arcod, a te szabályaid. Főleg a te arcod."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your name" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding: display name placeholder.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A neved"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your profile won't load. Usually that's the internet, occasionally it's us. Check your connection and try again." : {
      "comment" : "Profile failed to load: explanation.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nem töltődik be a profilod. Többnyire a net a ludas, néha mi. Nézd meg a kapcsolatot, és próbáld újra."
